// AWS Account Removed From Organization  [tier: alert]  ATT&CK: T1562, T1578
// Detects an account leaving or being removed from an AWS Organization (LeaveOrganization/RemoveAccountFromOrganization), which can detach it…
// False positives: Planned organizational restructuring.
// Source: rules/defense-evasion/organizations-leave-or-remove.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
eventName=/^LeaveOrganization$/i or eventName=/^RemoveAccountFromOrganization$/i eventSource=/^organizations\.amazonaws\.com$/i
